{"availability":"available","full":"Serkanbyx/video-streaming-platform","name":"video-streaming-platform","description":"A brutalist, glitch-aesthetic full-stack video streaming platform built as a TypeScript monorepo. Creators upload raw videos that are transcoded server-side with FFmpeg into HLS, then streamed to a React 19 client. Stack: React + Vite + Tailwind v4, Express 5 + Mongoose 8 + MongoDB, with Zod schemas shared end-to-end.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-22T10:05:10Z","updated":"2026-09-01T06:13:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://video-streaming-platformm.netlify.app/","topics":["brutalism","express","ffmpeg","fly-io","fullstack","hls","jwt","mongodb","mongoose","monorepo","netlify","nodejs","react","react19","streaming-platform","tailwindcss","typescript","video-streaming","vite","zod"],"demo":"https://video-streaming-platformm.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.398Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.398Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.398Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.398Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A brutalist, glitch-aesthetic full-stack video streaming platform built as a TypeScript monorepo. Creators upload raw video files that are transcoded server-side with FFmpeg into HLS (.m3u8 + .ts segments), then streamed to a React 19 client styled like a printed zine. The stack is React + Vite + Tailwind v4 on the client, Express 5 + Mongoose 8 + MongoDB on the server, with Zod schemas shared between both ends for end-to-end type safety."],"features":["HLS Video Pipeline — Raw uploads transcoded asynchronously with FFmpeg into single-bitrate HLS playlists and 10-second .ts segments, served by express.static with native HTTP Range support.","Three-Role Access Control — Strict hierarchy (viewer < creator < admin) enforced by protect, creatorOrAdmin, and adminOnly middleware with ownership checks on every mutation.","Creator Studio — Drag-and-drop upload with progress bar, MIME whitelist, size and duration caps, real-time processing status polling (pending → processing → ready / failed), and a per-creator dashboard.","Personalized Discovery — Search, sort (new / top / liked), pagination, channel subscriptions with a personal feed, watch history with timestamp deduplication, and a creator-overlap recommendation engine.","Nested Comments & Reactions — Top-level comments and replies with rate-limited writes, optimistic like/dislike with one-reaction-per-user enforcement, and cascade deletes."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Serkanbyx/video-streaming-platform/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"94a8b3d450aae8b421be00e67c6c97340cfcd67cbe4f2c50697275804f58ec61","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.592Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.592Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A brutalist, glitch-aesthetic full-stack video streaming platform built as a TypeScript monorepo. Creators upload raw video files that are transcoded server-side with FFmpeg into HLS (.m3u8 + .ts segments), then streamed to a React 19 client styled like a printed zine. The stack is React + Vite + Tailwind v4 on the client, Express 5 + Mongoose 8 + MongoDB on the server, with Zod schemas shared between both ends for end-to-end type safety.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Serkanbyx/video-streaming-platform/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in with the admin account you seeded.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Serkanbyx/video-streaming-platform/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A response interceptor catches 401 responses, clears the token, and redirects to /login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Serkanbyx/video-streaming-platform/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"94a8b3d450aae8b421be00e67c6c973